中药冰淇淋
Ice cream has joined a growing list of food items which are being combined with traditional Chinese medicine ingredients to cater to rising demand for an indulgent bite with health benefits. But medical experts said that these TCM-infused offerings do not offer practical health benefits and TCM prescriptions should be taken only under the guidance of professionals. As TCM is gaining popularity among young people, it is important to adjust daily dietary habits and lifestyles to keep healthy. Acupuncture, massage, cupping and other non-pharmaceutical therapies can also be considered, while the use of TCM medicines should be strictly monitored.